- NAC if needed
- ACLs
- Layer 2 security features (Port Security, DHCP Snooping, Dynamic ARP Inspection)
- Internal/Client Web portal
- On-Prem Cloud Branch (Spine-Leaf Architecture) - Terraform + VRFs if needed + n8n if needed

Politique d'utilisation

- Ensure all services are running with ansible (target servers)

- use netlab.tools in the next phase

- use netbox as source of truth for IPAM documentation

- use git for version control and collaboration on ansible playbooks and terraform configurations

- regularly update and patch all software tools to ensure security and stability

- document all configurations and changes made to the infrastructure for future reference and troubleshooting